Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}看看我  我在做果酱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, look at me. I'm making jam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.81,0:01:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我早上四点就起来了  那么早你怎么可能买得到水果{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I've been at it since 4:00 this morning.  Where'd you get fruit at 4 in the morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}在码头那边买的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Went down at the docks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你一定不知道能买到批发价{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Bet you didn't know you can get it wholesale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我根本不知道有码头{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I didn't know there were docks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.19,0:01:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.93,0:01:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你手断了吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Aw, is it broken?  Aw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.49,0:01:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不  但得挂着这东西几个星期{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, but I gotta wear this thing for a couple weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.58,0:01:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你有没有告诉医生  你是因为在床上跳才受伤{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Did you tell the doctor you did it jumping up and down on your bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不  我编的故事本来行得通的  但是…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No. I had a whole story worked out, but then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}钱德出卖了我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...Chandler sold me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.21,0:01:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}抱歉  乔伊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm sorry, Joe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想医生不会相信你说的手臂自己断了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I didn't think the doctor was gonna buy that it just fell out of his socket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这是什么  水果吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What is this? Fruit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}摩妮卡在做果酱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Monica's making jam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:01:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我最爱果酱了  我们家怎么从来没有果酱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Jam? I love jam. Hey, how come we never have jam at our place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}因为孩子们需要买新鞋{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Because the kids need new shoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.27,0:02:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我得做正事了  我不想再为理查的事烦心{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm going into business, people. I'm sick of being depressed about Richard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我需要一个计划  来忘记我的男人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I needed a plan. A plan to get over my man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.19,0:02:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么是男人的反义词   就是果酱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What's the opposite of man? Jam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔伊  别动  太烫了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Joey, don't. It's way too hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那么这就算我的了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}This will just be my batch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}(1-800-订花）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}到此止步  嘿  你这位穿名牌的…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um, that's it. No. Hey you. J. Crew guy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你干嘛跟踪我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah. Why are you following me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这一周来  我在哪里都能看到你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All week long, everywhere I look, there's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.28,0:02:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你不回我电话  又把我的信退回来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You wouldn't return my calls. You sent back my letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:02:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么   再给我一次机会  乌苏拉{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What?  One more chance, Ursula. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真是太尴尬了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh. Well, this is awkward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}怎么了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why? - Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你要找的是乌苏拉  而我是菲比  我们是双胞胎姐妹{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, because you want Ursula, and I'm Phoebe. Twin sisters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.04,0:03:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我认真的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.01,0:03:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真不好意思  我跟错人了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh. That's great. I'm stalking the wrong woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.47,0:03:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我真是个傻蛋{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I am such a dingus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你不是傻蛋{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, you're not a dingus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我只想让你知道  我不是一直这样的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I just... I want you to know I didn't used to be like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.31,0:03:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}在认识你姐姐之前  我只是{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Before I met your sister, I was, like, this normal guy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.77,0:03:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}卖手机的普通人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...who sold beepers and cellular phones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}听着  这不是你的错  知道吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well... I mean, look, it's not your fault, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.61,0:03:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}只是她对待男人就是这个样子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, this is just what she does to guys, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.57,0:03:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}就是…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}等等  我有个小故事告诉你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wait. You know what? I got a little story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.91,0:03:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我在念国中时{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}When I was in junior high school...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.37,0:03:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有一阵子  我以为自己是女巫{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...I went through this period where I thought I was a witch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有个辅导员老师跟我说了一段的话{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And there was this guidance counselor who said something to me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想可以帮助你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...that I think will help you a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他说〝你根本不是女巫  你只是个普通学生〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}He said, "Okay, you're not a witch. You're just an average student."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:04:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你懂我的意思吗  不是很懂{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}See what I'm saying?  Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}忘了这段感情吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um, well, get over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你看起来是个好人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, you just... You seem like a really nice guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}别太难为自己  好吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, I just... Don't be so hard on yourself, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.19,0:04:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没错  你说得没错  谢谢你对我这么好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wait, you're right. I know you're right. And thanks for being so nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}给你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Here. - Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Thanks a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.24,0:04:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你要不要去喝杯咖啡{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Do you wanna get a cup of coffee or...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好啊  好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, okay.  Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你不用走在我后面了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You don't have to walk behind me anymore.{\r}
